---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// Keep this date current whenever the substance of the policy changes.
const lastUpdated = 'July 28, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | K & A Performance"
  description="How K & A Performance collects, uses, and shares information on ka-performancefl.com, including form submissions, AI chat, and advertising pixels."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-40 pb-16 md:pt-48">
    <p data-animate="type-settle" class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent">
      Legal
    </p>
    <h1 data-animate="type-settle" data-animate-delay="0.1" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,7vw,4.5rem)] leading-[1.02]">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p data-animate="type-settle" data-animate-delay="0.2" class="mt-6 font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
      Last updated {lastUpdated}
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-32 md:pb-40">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
      <div>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
          K &amp; A Performance is a web design and AI integration studio based in Florida. This
          policy explains what information <strong class="text-ink">ka-performancefl.com</strong>
          collects, why, and who it is shared with. We keep the site deliberately light: there is
          no account system, no newsletter, and no third-party ads served on these pages.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Information you give us</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          When you use our contact form or the &ldquo;Start a project&rdquo; form, we collect what
          you type into it: your name, email address, and any company name, service interest,
          budget range, or project details you choose to share. These submissions are delivered to
          us by <a href="https://web3forms.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Web3Forms</a>,
          a form-delivery service that passes the message to our email inbox. We use it to reply to
          you and to keep ordinary business records of the enquiry. We do not sell it, and we do not
          add you to a mailing list.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">AI chat on this site</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Some pages offer a chat assistant that answers questions about our work and helps scope a
          project. The messages you type are sent to
          <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Anthropic</a>
          to generate a reply, and the reply is returned to your browser. We do not store these
          conversations on our servers. Please do not type sensitive personal information, passwords,
          or confidential material into the chat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Advertising measurement (Meta pixel)</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          This site uses Meta pixel technology to measure how our advertising performs. The pixel
          records that a page was viewed and that a contact form was completed, along with standard
          technical information such as your browser, device, and IP address, and it may set or read
          cookies. We use this only to understand whether our ads are working, not to build a profile
          of you.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          You can control how this information is used for advertising through your
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/adpreferences" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Facebook ad preferences</a>,
          and through Meta&rsquo;s
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">privacy policy</a>.
          Browser settings, tracking protection, and ad blockers will also prevent the pixel from
          loading, and the site works normally without it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Information collected automatically</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          This site is hosted on
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">Cloudflare</a>,
          which keeps standard server and security logs (including IP addresses) to serve pages and
          protect against abuse. Our public Google reviews are fetched from the Google Places API by
          our server; that request contains no information about you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          We do not use cookies for analytics or personalisation of our own. The Meta pixel described
          above may set cookies, and Cloudflare may set cookies necessary for security and
          performance. You can block or delete cookies in your browser at any time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Your choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to
          delete it. Email <a href="mailto:alex@ka-performancefl.com" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">alex@ka-performancefl.com</a>
          and we will handle it. You can also decline to use the forms or chat entirely, and browse
          the site with tracking protection enabled.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Children</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          This site is intended for businesses and adults. We do not knowingly collect information
          from children.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Changes and contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          If this policy changes in substance, we will update the date at the top of this page.
          Questions about any of it can go to
          <a href="mailto:alex@ka-performancefl.com" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-hot">alex@ka-performancefl.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
